<title>UK: Shell climbs as Hoare Govett repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Shell climbs as Hoare Govett repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc opened higher on Friday after analysts at ABN Amro Hoare Govett repeated &quot;buy&quot; advice on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 10-1/2p at 10.66 stg by 0741 GMT.</p>
<p>Market sources said the brokerage had repeated its position on the stock because of the strong reserve replacement figure in the 1996 annual report.</p>
<p>ABN Amro Hoare Govett has a share price target of 12.00 stg for Shell stock. --Elaine Hardcastle, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
